{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/etHnzxt6ftg46TAxHBCZtQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:56.880175+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/etHnzxt6ftg46TAxHBCZtQ","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/JrGmlPbQcN6krH60Viby3PFMfIhfzibCAb8V84pksJUyHKmDS3kLfPCKUrZ1ZegE3V6xIwEHKvy3Lf2Ntib5W1wuQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>“尔滨之约，公卫盛宴”2025年哈尔滨医科大学公共卫生学院大学生暑期夏令营活动拟定于2025年7月在学校本部举行，旨在通过此次活动提高研究生生源质量，鼓励学生报考我院研究生，进一步提高我校拔尖创新人才的选拔；同时通过活动的组织使学生获得“沉浸式”的研学体验，引导和激发学生从事科研的兴趣和热情，并为学生提供从招生、培养到就业的全过程的经验分享和实地交流。具体活动安排如下：</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>一、参营资格及待遇</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>计划招收46名营员，其中校内招收40名营员，校外招收6名营员（交通费用自理）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>校内营员不收取注册费、培训费、资料费，并免费提供夏令营期间校外活动中的餐食。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>二、活动时间安排（待定）</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/3Zibia4VHCynziboE7VntUNZeLqiapjdklfVwibMfUpaTmGfGRe5lpHic1EcvVhOKZuTzwGjnIxQgJZDxqz0CUUH4Rew/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>三、申请材料</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>扫描二维码填写《申请表》的同时，需要将以下申请材料的纸质版在申请截止日之前递交至研究生科办公室（咨询电话：0451-87502815），所有材料需要按照以下编号摆放，并装订在一起后放入不透明的信封中，信封封面标明申请人的姓名和学号：</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1.身份证、学生证复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.学习成绩单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.大学英语四级或（和）六级考试成绩单复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.自荐信1份，主要介绍本人的学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划等，以不超过800字为宜，无固定格式要求；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.其他（若有）：学术成果（如发表的学术论文、专利证书、互联网+或大创项目等）、荣誉证书复印件等。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>所有申请学生需确保提供的材料真实有效，如发现有不诚信行为将取消一切资格。</span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/3Zibia4VHCynziboE7VntUNZeLqiapjdklfVgGBokYltR7rWVThsSbbP7mkLS1JNrJmK493gsfEBcic1X3z5KqOIfibw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>四、夏令营报名及录取</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>暑期夏令营的报名时间预计4月16日-5月10日，经学院资格评审后，录取结果将于5月中旬进行公示。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>五、其他事项</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>夏令营活动坚持“安全第一”的原则，营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营活动，禁止擅自离营，并必须遵守学校及学院的相关规定，按照统一安排参加活动。学院会为营员购买参营期间的人身意外伤害保险。营员在夏令营期间发生的医疗费用及因个人行为导致的意外事故，保险外部分由营员本人承担。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>哈尔滨医科大学公共卫生学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025年4月16日</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>排版：宣传部 宫鑫杰</span></span></p><p><span><span>校对：秘书部 魏   馨</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核：刘振华 田懋一</span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>转自：哈医大公卫研究生</span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"55f047455cd91347c7c9192e785ff2a1f87ff63dababb2ee177aeb6ad86802d9","textLength":861,"sourceSha256":"45e305108ffd4f804b4461b09b1745d7ef366042b44bf923590f0f458b9cab0b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-329f62782de147950a6e","title":"2025年哈尔滨医科大学公共卫生学院“尔滨之约，公卫盛宴”大学生暑期夏令营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:56.880175+00:00"}
